From 67702d159a01cc121fb980148e6971212bf25a41 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 16:58:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] protected-wins: vulkan-uma-read-path-probe symbol re-homed to
 ggml-vulkan-buffers.cpp after the f172be756 split

Upstream f172be756 split ggml-vulkan.cpp; W1 moved ggml_vk_uma_direct_read_ok into ggml-vulkan-buffers.cpp but the manifest still anchored the symbol in ggml-vulkan.cpp, so the protected-win check reported a symbol problem on the W1 tip. Path list gains the new file; the symbol anchor moves with the code.

Origin: fork-authored (ArifiLabs lane-296 W1 collision maker, Opus 5.5)
Measured-effect: none - manifest only
Lane: lane-296
---
 tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json b/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json
index 989ec3f544..a7c23e6325 100644
--- a/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json
+++ b/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json
@@ -964,7 +964,8 @@
       "mechanism": "The UMA read-back direct memcpy is taken only when the buffer's OWN matched memory type is HOST_CACHED, probed per call from the flags stored at allocation, instead of unconditionally for every host-visible buffer on a UMA device. An uncached mapping falls through to the staging branch that every non-UMA host-visible (rebar) buffer already uses. GGML_ARIFI_UMA_READ_PATH = auto (default, probe) | direct (upstream behaviour) | staging (always staging). One stderr receipt per process names the resolved path and the env value, because llama-server drops ggml INFO records. Writes are untouched: write-combined is the right mode for CPU writes.",
       "commit": "2f241c57dd1dfb7d9430e851a0bc73db338e8adf",
       "protected_paths": [
-        "ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp"
+        "ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp",
+        "ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan-buffers.cpp"
       ],
       "anchors": [
         "GGML_ARIFI_UMA_READ_PATH",
@@ -972,7 +973,7 @@
         "ARIFI UMA read path"
       ],
       "symbols": {
-        "ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp": [
+        "ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan-buffers.cpp": [
           "ggml_vk_uma_direct_read_ok"
         ]
       },
